      <Property key="Smiles" value="C([[branched chain &amp;alpha;-keto acid dehydrogenase] lipoyl carrier component])C(=O)[C@H](CCCCNC(CCCC[C@@H]1(SSCC1))=O)N[[branched chain &amp;alpha;-keto acid dehydrogenase] lipoyl carrier component]" />
